        "independent_answer": "tmp=-8 initially; after i=1: -3; i=2: -3; i=3: -1; return -1. Initializing tmp=0 incorrectly returns 0, which is not an input element. Require 1 <= n <= number of accessible score elements.",
        "reasoning": "Each iteration preserves the maximum of score[0..i]. i increases by one toward n; for the example there are exactly three iterations.",
